#: web/pages/storage/StoragePage.tsx
msgid "When the disk has less free space than this, the oldest recordings are deleted first."
msgstr "硬碟剩下的空間少於這個值時，先刪除最舊的錄影。"

#: web/pages/status/explain.ts
msgid "When the graphics card can't decode, video is decoded by the CPU instead. Recording and motion detection still work, but the CPU does some extra work. You can pick another graphics card or switch back to automatic in “Settings → General”. The reason is written in “Copy diagnostics”."
msgstr "顯示卡無法解碼時，影像會改由處理器解碼，錄影與動作偵測仍然正常，只是會多吃一些處理器。可以到「設定 → 一般」換一張顯示卡，或改回自動；原因寫在「複製診斷資訊」裡。"

#: web/pages/events/EventsPage.tsx
msgid "When this camera detects motion, the event shows up here."
msgstr "這台偵測到動作時，事件會出現在這裡。"

#: web/pages/settings-cameras/CameraFormPage.tsx
msgid "When you're done, press \"Test and save\". If the connection works, it's saved and starts recording right away."
msgstr "填好後按「測試並儲存」，連線成功就會直接儲存，並馬上開始錄影。"

#: web/pages/states/NewSensorPage.tsx
msgid "Where pictures come from"
msgstr "畫面從哪裡來"

#: web/pages/status/ResourcesCard.tsx
msgid "Where resources go"
msgstr "資源花在哪裡"

#: web/pages/camera/PtzPresets.tsx
msgid "Where the camera is pointing now is stored on the camera."
msgstr "鏡頭現在對著的位置會存到相機裡。"

#: web/pages/status/explain.ts
msgid "While object detection is stopped, recording and motion detection are not affected, but events won't be tagged with what was seen. Cameras set to “Filter” create events from ordinary motion instead. If it is still stopped after a restart, use “Copy diagnostics” at the bottom of the page to find the cause, or go to “Settings → Object detection” to switch the model or inference device."
msgstr "物件辨識停下來時，錄影與動作偵測不受影響，只是事件不會標上看到的東西；設成「過濾」的攝影機會改成照一般動作建立事件。重新啟動後仍然停止，請用頁面下方的「複製診斷資訊」找原因，也可以到「設定 → 物件辨識」換一個辨識模型或推論裝置。"

